<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixia</span></b> , ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βριξία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in</i> Gallia Cisalpina, now <i>Brescia</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 5, 35,
				1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">32, 30,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 19, 23, § 132</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Just. 20,
			5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cat. 67, 32</span></i> (<i><span class="en">id. 33</span></i>
			and 34 suspicious; v. Sillig <i>N.
			cr.</i>).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixĭānus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>pertaining to Brixia</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Galli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv. 21, 25, 14</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">porta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 27</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixĭāni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, <i>the
			Brixians</i>, <i><span class="en">Inscr. Orell.
			1971</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Brixĭensis</span></b> ,
			e, adj., <i>of Brixia</i>
			(post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">episcopus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug.
					Ep. 222</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">id. Haeres. 41</span></i>: Brixianus).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
